<TeXmacs|2.1.4>

<style|<tuple|generic|gui-button>>

<\body>
  <use-module|(doc gui-markup-examples)>

  <strong|Tabs.> A click on a passive tab shows its page (<verbatim|passive-tab> is a link: in an editable document a double click may be needed).

  <tabs|<tabs-bar|<active-tab|General>|<passive-tab|Advanced>|<passive-tab|About>>|<tabs-body|<shown|The general settings.>|<hidden|The advanced settings.>|<hidden|About this example.>>>

</body>

